From: monish.v <monish.v@airoha.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: print NPU version as major.minor.patch

The NPU fw version word is encoded as major[31:24].minor[23:16].patch[15:0].
Decode it accordingly instead of printing the upper 16 bits as one field.

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 mt7996/npu.c |    4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/mt7996/npu.c
+++ b/mt7996/npu.c
@@ -210,8 +210,8 @@ static int mt7996_npu_offload_init(struc
 		return err;
 	}
 
-	dev_info(dev->mt76.dev, "NPU version: %0d.%d\n",
-		 (val >> 16) & 0xffff, val & 0xffff);
+	dev_info(dev->mt76.dev, "NPU version: %u.%u.%u\n",
+		 (val >> 24) & 0xff, (val >> 16) & 0xff, val & 0xffff);
 
 	err = mt76_npu_send_msg(npu, 0, WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_PCIE_PORT_TYPE,
 				dev->mt76.mmio.npu_type, GFP_KERNEL);
